# Evil at the Inlet (crystalWar 21, call-only), the edges: a level 29 Warrior in Crawlers' Nest [S] (missions as the
# main flow). No ribbon: Rodeupansat's script 106; the ribbon (a GM), level 29: 106. Vunkerl Inlet [S]: qm6 available:
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Accepted by a GM, no seal, the bag full (a GM): Rodeupansat 109, finished: no room: not
# completed; 109 again.
lists CrawlersNestS/Rodeupansat/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/qm6/onTrigger CrawlersNestS/onEventFinish/109
char zone=CrawlersNestS pos=130.74,-34.353,25.927 job=WAR lvl=29
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Rodeupansat                     # no ribbon: 106
finish
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService           # a GM
trigger Rodeupansat                     # level 29: 106
finish
warp -633.885,-51.101,-454.311 VunkerlInletS
trigger qm6                             # available: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
quest CrystalWar.EvilAtTheInlet accepted # a GM
fill-inventory                          # a GM: no slot free
warp 130.74,-34.353,25.927 CrawlersNestS
trigger Rodeupansat                     # accepted, no seal: 109
finish                                  # no room for the scroll: not completed
trigger Rodeupansat                     # still accepted: 109
